<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Welcome to KKIT</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">Welcome to KKIT!</h1>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Welcome to KKIT! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
    <p>Here's what you can do next:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Explore our courses</li>
      <li>Complete your profile</li>
      <li>Join a community of learners</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{clientUrl}}/courses" style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">Browse Courses</a>
    </div>
    <p>Need help? Reply to this email or visit our <a href="{{clientUrl}}/support">support page</a>.</p>
    <p>Happy Learning!<br>The KKIT Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
